  "details": "As of now I self limit my homeworlds to be under a certain megabyte threshold. I go through the 20gb cache pretty quickly by joining big lobbies and world hopping which means I frequently have to redownload my homeworld over and over again. \n\nAn option you can select to never clear your homeworlds cache would benefit users and VRChat since it is somewhat redundant to download the same thing multiple times. The option would save time, allow people like me to set bigger homeworlds, and reduce needless network downloads.",
